00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
The Ugly Duckling and Me!

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
is a 2006 animated comedy drama film directed by
Michael Hegner and Karsten Kiilerich.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Intended for a family audience, it is a modern adaptation of the 1843
fairy tale "The Ugly Duckling" by Hans Christian Andersen.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Yorkshire Post described it as a "feel good" film for family audiences.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film follows over a rat named Ratso who strives to become a famous showman.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
His life changes when an egg falls out of its nest revealing an ugly duckling
with brushy grey wings, and he is forced to becomes a father.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
It also won an award at the China International
Cartoon and Digital Art Festival.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film initially premiered in Denmark on 6 April 2006.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and mind_bending.
